OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral takes place for pastor
OL,4,Akilled at festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA funeral has taken place for the man
OL,7,Fkilled by a large falling sign at a
OL,8,Freligious event in West Sussex this
OL,9,Fsummer.
OL,11,FRobert Guanco, 41, had been a pastor at
OL,12,FJesus the Living Water Church in
OL,13,FEastbourne, East Sussex.
OL,15,FSix other people were injured during
OL,16,Fthe incident at the Big Church Festival
OL,17,Fin Wiston Park, near Steyning, on
OL,18,FFriday August 28, four of whom were
OL,19,Ftaken to hospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
