OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral takes place for pastor
OL,4,Akilled at festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the service at Guanco's church
OL,7,Fon Friday, he was described as "a
OL,8,Fbeautiful soul who touched all of our
OL,9,Flives profoundly" and someone who
OL,10,F"always looked out for others before
OL,11,Fhimself".
